    <http://example.org/node/chunk169> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) is seeking a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) hospital staff in its hospital staff daily activities. a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support its hospital staff in their daily activities must be designed to improve the efficiency of staff and the quality and safety of patient care, while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and data sovereignty. a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support its hospital staff in their daily activities is based on a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase gate structure suited to public and health procurement. a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase gate structure suited to public and health procurement allows for close collaboration with the client to identify and prioritize requirements, while also ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and data sovereignty. a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support its hospital staff in their daily activities will be hosted on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent, with no dependency on non-European suppliers. a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support its hospital staff in their daily activities will provide support in drafting medical and administrative documents, as well as analyzing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications. a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support its hospital staff in their daily activities will also facilitate access to reliable and up-to-date information drawn from The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts. a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support its hospital staff in their daily activities must be designed as a non-decisional support tool, with no automated decision-making without explicit validation by a qualified professional. a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support its hospital staff in their daily activities will provide explainable recommendations or suggestions, with a clear audit trail and source grounding. a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support its hospital staff in their daily activities will also ensure medical confidentiality, known as \"secret médical,\" and comply with personal and health data protection regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision may be automated. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk170> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support its hospital staff in their daily activities must achieve a high level of answer relevance and provide response times compatible with daily clinical use. a comprehensive AI assistance solution to support its hospital staff in their daily activities must also guarantee a high level of availability, with an availability target of 99.9%, and integrate with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk171> a prov:Entity ;
